        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 12.08.050</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 506)</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=16.72">Chapter 16.72</a> REPEALED (Limited Access Facilities)</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.72.120">Section 16.72.120</a> REPEALED (Violations Specified – Penalty)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 507)</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=16.74">Chapter 16.74</a> REPEALED (Blind/Handicapped and Disabled Persons – "White Cane" Law)</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.74.040">Section 16.74.040</a> REPEALED (Standard of Care for Drivers of Motor Vehicles – Blind Pedestrians Carrying White Cane or Using Guide Dog)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 508)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.74.060">Section 16.74.060</a> REPEALED (Unauthorized Use of White Cane or Guide Dog)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 508)</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=16.76">Chapter 16.76</a> REPEALED (Traffic, Vehicles and Transportation, Miscellaneous)</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.76.010">Section 16.76.010</a> REPEALED (Blocking Streets by Railroad Companies)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 510)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.76.020">Section 16.76.020</a> REPEALED (Streets Closed to Trucks)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 12.08.010</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 485)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.76.030">Section 16.76.030</a> REPEALED (Trains at Crossing – Operation Of)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 511)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.76.040">Section 16.76.040</a> REPEALED (Truck Routes Designated)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 12.08.020</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 486)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.76.050">Section 16.76.050</a> REPEALED (Weight Limit Imposed)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 12.08.030</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 487)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.76.060">Section 16.76.060</a> REPEALED (Arterial Streets Designated)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 12.08.040</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 488)</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=16.80">Chapter 16.80</a> REPEALED (Air Quality Implementation Plan)</p>
        					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.80.010">Section 16.80.010</a> REPEALED (In General)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 15.02.010</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 491)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.80.020">Section 16.80.020</a> REPEALED (Central Business District Portion of Nonattainment Area – Carbon Monoxide)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 15.02.030</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 493)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.80.030">Section 16.80.030</a> REPEALED (Idling Defined)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 15.02.020</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 492)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.80.040">Section 16.80.040</a> REPEALED (Excessive Idling Prohibited)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 15.02.040</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 494)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.80.060">Section 16.80.060</a> REPEALED (No-parking Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 15.02.050</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 495)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.80.070">Section 16.80.070</a> REPEALED (Tow-away Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 15.02.060</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 496)</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=16.80.080">Section 16.80.080</a> REPEALED (Existing Restrictions Rescinded)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 497)</p></form>
